{
  "_comment": "Which Library/ file types and deck concepts this server's parameters refer to. The orchestrator reads this at discovery time and turns the named parameters into the right picker. Entries with \"dynamic\": true are not folder listings — they are resolved at runtime (the deck ones from the active hardware config, see v1/src/deck.py). Everything else here is also this server speaking for itself: result_types are the Results/ folders it writes (created at startup), traceability says which command prepares a plate. See v1/src/catalog.py.",
