    "_comment": "What this server's commands physically occupy. deck:opentrons is this deck as a space: the mobile robot's place_on_OT / pick_from_OT tasks claim the same id, which is what stops a recipe starting with an arm inside it. control:true marks a command that must run WHILE the robot is busy. See v1/docs/RESOURCE_MODEL.md.",
